  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bushika Arabica Coffee Processing and Marketing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture. Crops Coffee.Beneficiaries: 3040 smallholder farmers of whom 1,583..Project funds will be used procure post-harvest handling and processing equipment (motorized coffee pulpers, industrial coffee grinder, platform weighing scales, moisture meters) and completion of the store. Other project funds will be used to provide technical assistance in the area of marketing with particular for on branding the Cooperative&apos;s coffee. .</narrative>
  </description>
